# Copy to .claude/gate-core-paths and edit. One extended regex per line.
# A branch touching any of these runs the FULL suite at merge; other code runs
# only the tests covering the touched files; styles/markup/assets/docs run none.
# Without the real file, every code change runs the full suite (safe default).
#
# Typical shared core, by stack:
# Flutter:    ^lib/(models|services|data|core)/   ^pubspec\.(yaml|lock)$
# Supabase:   ^supabase/(migrations|functions)/
# Node/TS:    ^src/(lib|services|domain)/          ^package(-lock)?\.json$
# WordPress:  ^wp-content/plugins/<core>/src/      ^wp-content/themes/<t>/(functions\.php|inc/)
# Java API:   ^services/api/                       ^contracts/
